WithdrawAll_ERC4626_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when yieldVault not allowlisted
│  └── it should revert with VaultNotAllowed
└── when yieldVault allowlisted
   ├── given vault has no share position
   │  └── it should revert with NoPosition
   └── given vault has share position
      ├── given vault has not approved adapter on shares
      │  └── it should revert in the yield vault on share allowance check
      └── given vault approved adapter on shares
         ├── it should read live share balance
         ├── it should call yieldVault.redeem with shares equal to live balance
         ├── it should set owner equal to vault
         ├── it should set receiver equal to vault
         ├── it should transfer asset to vault
         └── it should leave vault share balance at zero
